# Cloudflare Pages response headers.
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
#
# COOP/COEP enables cross-origin isolation, which is required for
# SharedArrayBuffer. Without it, ONNX Runtime Web in the Splitter's
# ML mode falls back to single-thread WASM (~15-25 min/song instead
# of ~3-5 min). Other browser-side ML usage benefits the same way.

/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp

# Long cache for the static brand asset
/logo.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
